        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ohurrege Omukama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'oha anyakusisana nk'omuntu omunyamagezi? Kandi n'oha anyakumanyire kusoborra amakuru g'ebintu? Amagezi g'omuntu, gamuleetera okwangasana ha maiso, kandi gamumaraho engonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwatege ekiragiro ky'omukama kandi habw'endahiro yaawe ey'ekitiinisa, olekege kwekanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekintu obu kiraabaga kitali kirungi omurugege omumaiso, otalibandaara, habwokuba akora kyona eki akagonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, ekigambo ky'omukama ky'obusobozi bwingi muno, kandi n'oha ow'asobora kumukaguza ati “N'okora ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu anyakukwata ekiragiro, talihikwaho kabi, kandi omutima ogw'omuntu ow'amagezi gumanya akasumi n'omuhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba emihanda ya Ruhanga omuntu tasobora kugimanya omuhito gw'omuntu noobu guraaba gumulemeera, buli kintu, kigira akasumi kaakyo n'omuhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu tamanya ekirukwija kubaho. N'oha ow'alimugambira nkooku kiribaho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu tasobora kwangira obwomeezi, kandi ekiro ky'okufa, takiinaho busobozi, tikisoboka, kuraga kuruga omu bulemu obu, kandi abo abaayehaire obubi, obubi tibulibajuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu namaliire omutima gwange ha bintu byona ebinyakukorwa omunsi, omuntu obu aba naalemesa ireme omuntu mutaahi we amusaalize, nubwo nayetegeriize ebi byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, nkarora ababi bamazire kuziikwa, baataahaga nibaturuka omu kiikaro ekirukwera, kandi baahaisanizibwaga omu rubuga oru baakorramuga ebintu nk'ebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, omusango ogw'ekikorwa ekibi, tigucwiibwa bwango, omutima gw'abantu, gukahwera ha kukora ebibi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusiisi, noobu asiisa emirundi kikumi, buli kiro, kandi akahangaara, baitu mmanyire abo abanyakutiina Ruhanga nkooku baliba kurungi, habwokuba bamutamu ekitiinisa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu ababi tibalitunga businge, obwomeezi bwabo nibusisana ekiituuru, kandi balifa bakiri bato, habwokuba, tibatiina Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu, haroho ekitaina mugaso ekinyakurorwa omunsi; abantu abarungi bakolerwa ebintu ebinyakusemeriire ababi; kandi ababi, bakolerwa ebintu ebinyakusemeriire abarungi. Eki nakyo, ningamba nti, tikiina mugaso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, ninsiima okwegonza, habwokuba, omuntu omunsi, tainamu kintu kirungi na kimu, okwihaho okulya, okunywa, n'okwegonza, ebi byonka omu biro byona eby'obwomeezi bwe, Ruhanga obu yamuhaire omunsi nibyo araihaga omu mulimo gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkooku nataireho muno omutima ha kwega, nkeetegereza ekintu ekinyakubaho omunsi munu. Mazimakwo nyamusana n'ekiro amaiso g'omuntu tigahuumura ebiro byona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hanyuma nkarora omulimo gwa Ruhanga gwona namanya omuntu nkooku atasobora kwetegereza omulimo ogunyakukorwa omunsi. Noobu araatalibana akaserra ata, eki talikyetegereza; omuntu omunyamagezi noobu araagamba ngu amanyire, eki tasobora kukimanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
